## Interface: 11507, 16001
## Title: PadKeys - Fade
## Notes: Fades Blizzard's bars, menus, unit frames, experience bar and quest tracker out until you need them (mouseover, combat, a target, loot, experience), with a label on each bar naming its PadKeys key; switches between your healer and other Edit Mode layouts by role. Needs PadKeys.
## Author: wow-forever-data-science
## Version: 0.1.0
## Dependencies: PadKeys
## OptionalDeps: PadKeys_Radial, PadKeys_Bar, PadKeys_Debug

